{"seq":1,"slug":"r-data-types-structures","title":"R 数据类型与结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/fundamentals/r-data-types-structures","wordCount":1449,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"r-数据类型与结构\">R 数据类型与结构</h1><p>R 的类型系统围绕一个核心假设构建：所有数据都是向量。标量不存在——数字 <code>42</code> 是长度为 1 的数值向量，字符串 <code>&quot;hello&quot;</code> 是长度为 1 的字符向量。这个设计决策让 R 天然适合批量数据操作，但也给习惯标量语言的程序员带来认知负担。理解类型系统是写出正确且高效 R 代码的第一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>一切都是向量</strong>：R 没有标量，<code>42</code> 是长度 1 的数值向量；批量数据操作是语言的第一性设计，而非附加特性。</li>\n<li><strong>原子类型只有六种</strong>：logical、integer、double、complex、character、raw，每种只能容纳同质元素。</li>\n<li><strong>隐式转换有固定方向</strong>：<code>logical &lt; integer &lt; double &lt; complex &lt; character</code>，混合类型时向&quot;更高&quot;类型强制转换。</li>\n<li><strong>复合结构建立在原子向量与列表之上</strong>：matrix/array 是带 <code>dim</code> 属性的原子向量，data.frame/tibble 是等长向量的命名列表。</li>\n<li><strong>NA 是类型化的缺失值标记</strong>，不是普通值，因此不能用 <code>==</code> 检测。</li>\n<li><strong>属性承载对象语义</strong>：<code>class</code> 属性驱动 S3 泛型的方法分派。</li>\n<li><strong>copy-on-modify 决定内存行为</strong>：赋值共享内存，修改时才触发复制。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"六种原子类型\">六种原子类型</h2><p>R 定义了六种原子（atomic）类型，每种都只能容纳同质元素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th><code>typeof()</code> 返回值</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>存储大小</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逻辑</td>\n<td><code>logical</code></td>\n<td><code>TRUE</code>, <code>FALSE</code>, <code>NA</code></td>\n<td>4 bytes</td>\n<td>条件筛选、布尔运算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整数</td>\n<td><code>integer</code></td>\n<td><code>1L</code>, <code>2L</code>, <code>NA_integer_</code></td>\n<td>4 bytes</td>\n<td>计数、索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双精度</td>\n<td><code>double</code></td>\n<td><code>3.14</code>, <code>Inf</code>, <code>NaN</code></td>\n<td>8 bytes</td>\n<td>连续数值计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复数</td>\n<td><code>complex</code></td>\n<td><code>1+2i</code></td>\n<td>16 bytes</td>\n<td>信号处理、傅里叶变换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符</td>\n<td><code>character</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;text&quot;</code></td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>文本数据、因子标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原始</td>\n<td><code>raw</code></td>\n<td><code>as.raw(0xff)</code></td>\n<td>1 byte</td>\n<td>二进制协议、文件 I/O</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>类型层级决定了隐式转换方向：<code>logical &lt; integer &lt; double &lt; complex &lt; character</code>。当不同类型混合在同一向量中时，R 自动向&quot;更高&quot;类型强制转换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"c(TRUE, 1L, 3.14, &quot;text&quot;)&#10;# [1] &quot;TRUE&quot; &quot;1&quot; &quot;3.14&quot; &quot;text&quot;  — 全部被强制为 character\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>c(TRUE, 1L, 3.14, \"text\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># [1] \"TRUE\" \"1\" \"3.14\" \"text\"  — 全部被强制为 character</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>NA</code> 是 R 处理缺失值的核心机制。每种原子类型有对应的 NA 常量（<code>NA_real_</code>、<code>NA_integer_</code>、<code>NA_character_</code>、<code>NA_complex_</code>），但通常直接写 <code>NA</code> 由上下文推断类型即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四种复合数据结构\">四种复合数据结构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[R 数据结构] --&gt; B[原子向量 atomic vector]&#10;    A --&gt; C[列表 list]&#10;    B --&gt; D[矩阵 matrix]&#10;    B --&gt; E[数组 array]&#10;    C --&gt; F[数据框 data.frame]&#10;    C --&gt; G[环境 environment]&#10;    F --&gt; H[tibble]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;dim 属性&quot;| B&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;dim 属性&quot;| B&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;等长列表 + class&quot;| C\">graph TD\n    A[R 数据结构] --&gt; B[原子向量 atomic vector]\n    A --&gt; C[列表 list]\n    B --&gt; D[矩阵 matrix]\n    B --&gt; E[数组 array]\n    C --&gt; F[数据框 data.frame]\n    C --&gt; G[环境 environment]\n    F --&gt; H[tibble]\n    D --&gt;|\"dim 属性\"| B\n    E --&gt;|\"dim 属性\"| B\n    F --&gt;|\"等长列表 + class\"| C</pre><h3 id=\"向量-vector\">向量（Vector）</h3><p>向量是 R 最基本的数据结构。创建方式包括 <code>c()</code>、<code>seq()</code>、<code>rep()</code>、<code>:</code> 运算符：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"nums &lt;- c(1.2, 3.4, 5.6)&#10;indices &lt;- 1:100&#10;repeated &lt;- rep(0, times = 50)&#10;sequence &lt;- seq(from = 0, to = 1, by = 0.01)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>nums &#x3C;- c(1.2, 3.4, 5.6)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indices &#x3C;- 1:100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>repeated &#x3C;- rep(0, times = 50)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sequence &#x3C;- seq(from = 0, to = 1, by = 0.01)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>向量支持按位置索引（从 1 开始）、逻辑索引和名称索引三种子集操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"x &lt;- c(a = 10, b = 20, c = 30)&#10;x[2]         # 位置索引 → 20&#10;x[c(TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)]  # 逻辑索引 → c(a=10, c=30)&#10;x[&quot;b&quot;]       # 名称索引 → 20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>x &#x3C;- c(a = 10, b = 20, c = 30)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x[2]         # 位置索引 → 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x[c(TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)]  # 逻辑索引 → c(a=10, c=30)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x[\"b\"]       # 名称索引 → 20</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"矩阵与数组-matrix-array\">矩阵与数组（Matrix / Array）</h3><p>矩阵是带有 <code>dim</code> 属性的原子向量——数据按列优先（column-major）存储：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"m &lt;- matrix(1:12, nrow = 3, ncol = 4)&#10;# 等价于：&#10;m2 &lt;- 1:12&#10;dim(m2) &lt;- c(3, 4)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>m &#x3C;- matrix(1:12, nrow = 3, ncol = 4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 等价于：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>m2 &#x3C;- 1:12</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dim(m2) &#x3C;- c(3, 4)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>矩阵运算遵循线性代数规则。<code>%*%</code> 为矩阵乘法，<code>*</code> 为逐元素乘法，<code>t()</code> 转置，<code>solve()</code> 求逆：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"A &lt;- matrix(c(1, 2, 3, 4), nrow = 2)&#10;b &lt;- c(5, 6)&#10;x &lt;- solve(A, b)  # 解 Ax = b\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>A &#x3C;- matrix(c(1, 2, 3, 4), nrow = 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>b &#x3C;- c(5, 6)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x &#x3C;- solve(A, b)  # 解 Ax = b</span></span></code></pre></div><p>数组将维度扩展到任意维数：<code>array(data, dim = c(3, 4, 2))</code> 创建三维数组。</p>\n<h3 id=\"列表-list\">列表（List）</h3><p>列表是 R 的异质容器——每个元素可以是任意类型、任意长度的对象：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"model_result &lt;- list(&#10;  coefficients = c(intercept = 2.1, slope = 0.8),&#10;  residuals = rnorm(100),&#10;  call = quote(lm(y ~ x)),&#10;  converged = TRUE&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>model_result &#x3C;- list(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  coefficients = c(intercept = 2.1, slope = 0.8),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  residuals = rnorm(100),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  call = quote(lm(y ~ x)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  converged = TRUE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>列表支持 <code>[[]]</code> 提取单个元素和 <code>$</code> 按名访问。这两者返回元素本身；<code>[]</code> 则返回子列表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"model_result[[1]]          # 返回向量 c(intercept=2.1, slope=0.8)&#10;model_result$coefficients  # 同上&#10;model_result[1]            # 返回长度为1的列表\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>model_result[[1]]          # 返回向量 c(intercept=2.1, slope=0.8)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model_result$coefficients  # 同上</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model_result[1]            # 返回长度为1的列表</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"数据框-data-frame\">数据框（Data Frame）</h3><p>数据框是等长向量的命名列表，加上 <code>&quot;data.frame&quot;</code> 类属性。它是 R 中表格数据的标准容器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"df &lt;- data.frame(&#10;  name = c(&quot;Alice&quot;, &quot;Bob&quot;, &quot;Charlie&quot;),&#10;  age = c(25L, 30L, 35L),&#10;  score = c(88.5, 92.0, 76.3),&#10;  stringsAsFactors = FALSE&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>df &#x3C;- data.frame(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name = c(\"Alice\", \"Bob\", \"Charlie\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  age = c(25L, 30L, 35L),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  score = c(88.5, 92.0, 76.3),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  stringsAsFactors = FALSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>tibble（来自 tidyverse）是 data.frame 的现代替代，改进了打印行为、禁止了部分匹配、不自动转换字符为因子：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(tibble)&#10;tb &lt;- tibble(&#10;  name = c(&quot;Alice&quot;, &quot;Bob&quot;, &quot;Charlie&quot;),&#10;  age = c(25L, 30L, 35L),&#10;  score = c(88.5, 92.0, 76.3)&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(tibble)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tb &#x3C;- tibble(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name = c(\"Alice\", \"Bob\", \"Charlie\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  age = c(25L, 30L, 35L),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  score = c(88.5, 92.0, 76.3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"因子-分类数据的专用类型\">因子：分类数据的专用类型</h2><p>因子（factor）是整数向量加上 <code>levels</code> 属性，专门表示分类变量。它区分有序和无序两种：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 无序因子&#10;blood_type &lt;- factor(c(&quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;O&quot;, &quot;A&quot;, &quot;AB&quot;))&#10;levels(blood_type)  # [1] &quot;A&quot; &quot;AB&quot; &quot;B&quot; &quot;O&quot;&#10;&#10;# 有序因子&#10;education &lt;- ordered(&#10;  c(&quot;高中&quot;, &quot;本科&quot;, &quot;硕士&quot;, &quot;本科&quot;),&#10;  levels = c(&quot;高中&quot;, &quot;本科&quot;, &quot;硕士&quot;, &quot;博士&quot;)&#10;)&#10;education[1] &lt; education[3]  # TRUE\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 无序因子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>blood_type &#x3C;- factor(c(\"A\", \"B\", \"O\", \"A\", \"AB\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>levels(blood_type)  # [1] \"A\" \"AB\" \"B\" \"O\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 有序因子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>education &#x3C;- ordered(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  c(\"高中\", \"本科\", \"硕士\", \"本科\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  levels = c(\"高中\", \"本科\", \"硕士\", \"博士\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>education[1] &#x3C; education[3]  # TRUE</span></span></code></pre></div><p>因子在统计建模中至关重要——<code>lm()</code> 和 <code>glm()</code> 自动将因子转换为虚拟变量（dummy coding）。对比处理（treatment contrast）是默认行为，第一个 level 作为参照组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"属性与-s3-类系统\">属性与 S3 类系统</h2><p>R 的对象系统建立在属性（attribute）之上。任何对象都可以附加任意属性，而 <code>class</code> 属性决定方法分派：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"x &lt;- 1:10&#10;attr(x, &quot;custom_info&quot;) &lt;- &quot;这是自定义属性&quot;&#10;class(x) &lt;- &quot;my_vector&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>x &#x3C;- 1:10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>attr(x, \"custom_info\") &#x3C;- \"这是自定义属性\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class(x) &#x3C;- \"my_vector\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>S3 是 R 最常用的面向对象系统——轻量、基于约定而非强制。泛型函数通过 <code>UseMethod()</code> 分派到 <code>generic.class</code> 形式的方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 定义泛型&#10;describe &lt;- function(x, ...) UseMethod(&quot;describe&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 定义方法&#10;describe.numeric &lt;- function(x, ...) {&#10;  cat(&quot;数值向量，长度:&quot;, length(x), &quot;均值:&quot;, mean(x), &quot;\\n&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;describe.character &lt;- function(x, ...) {&#10;  cat(&quot;字符向量，长度:&quot;, length(x), &quot;唯一值:&quot;, length(unique(x)), &quot;\\n&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 定义泛型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>describe &#x3C;- function(x, ...) UseMethod(\"describe\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 定义方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>describe.numeric &#x3C;- function(x, ...) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cat(\"数值向量，长度:\", length(x), \"均值:\", mean(x), \"\\n\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>describe.character &#x3C;- function(x, ...) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cat(\"字符向量，长度:\", length(x), \"唯一值:\", length(unique(x)), \"\\n\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>R 4.5+ 的生态正在向 S7 迁移——ggplot2 4.0 已采用 S7，它结合了 S3 的灵活性和 S4 的严格性。但 S3 仍是理解 R 对象模型的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"copy-on-modify-与内存模型\">Copy-on-Modify 与内存模型</h2><p>R 采用 copy-on-modify 语义：赋值不复制数据，修改时才触发复制。这通过引用计数实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"x &lt;- 1:1e6&#10;y &lt;- x          # 此时 x 和 y 共享同一内存&#10;y[1] &lt;- 0L      # 此时 y 被复制，x 不受影响\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>x &#x3C;- 1:1e6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>y &#x3C;- x          # 此时 x 和 y 共享同一内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>y[1] &#x3C;- 0L      # 此时 y 被复制，x 不受影响</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>tracemem()</code> 可以追踪对象何时被复制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"x &lt;- 1:1e6&#10;tracemem(x)&#10;x[1] &lt;- 0L    # 打印复制事件\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>x &#x3C;- 1:1e6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tracemem(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x[1] &#x3C;- 0L    # 打印复制事件</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ALTREP（Alternative Representation）是 R 3.5 引入的内部优化框架，R 4.5/4.6 持续改进。它允许某些向量以紧凑形式存储——例如 <code>1:1e9</code> 不实际分配 8GB 内存，而只存储起止值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"x &lt;- 1:1e9&#10;object.size(x)    # 显示 680 bytes，而非 8GB&#10;.Internal(inspect(x))  # 显示 ALTREP compact intseq\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>x &#x3C;- 1:1e9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object.size(x)    # 显示 680 bytes，而非 8GB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.Internal(inspect(x))  # 显示 ALTREP compact intseq</span></span></code></pre></div><p>理解 copy-on-modify 对性能至关重要：在循环中逐步增长向量（<code>x &lt;- c(x, new_value)</code>）会导致 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 复制开销。正确做法是预分配后填充，或使用<a href=\"vectorized-operations\">向量化运算</a>避免显式循环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"类型检查与转换的实践模式\">类型检查与转换的实践模式</h2><p>防御性编程中，类型检查应使用 <code>is.*()</code> 系列函数而非 <code>class()</code>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查目标</th>\n<th>推荐方式</th>\n<th>不推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>是否数值</td>\n<td><code>is.numeric(x)</code></td>\n<td><code>class(x) == &quot;numeric&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否整数</td>\n<td><code>is.integer(x)</code></td>\n<td><code>typeof(x) == &quot;integer&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否数据框</td>\n<td><code>is.data.frame(x)</code></td>\n<td><code>class(x) == &quot;data.frame&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否 NA</td>\n<td><code>is.na(x)</code></td>\n<td><code>x == NA</code>（永远返回 NA）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否 NULL</td>\n<td><code>is.null(x)</code></td>\n<td><code>x == NULL</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>显式类型转换使用 <code>as.*()</code> 系列：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"as.integer(3.7)    # 3（截断，非四舍五入）&#10;as.character(123)  # &quot;123&quot;&#10;as.numeric(&quot;3.14&quot;) # 3.14&#10;as.numeric(&quot;abc&quot;)  # NA，带警告\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>as.integer(3.7)    # 3（截断，非四舍五入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>as.character(123)  # \"123\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>as.numeric(\"3.14\") # 3.14</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>as.numeric(\"abc\")  # NA，带警告</span></span></code></pre></div><p>掌握 R 的类型系统后，下一步是理解为何向量化运算能让代码既简洁又高效——这是<a href=\"vectorized-operations\">向量化运算与函数式编程</a>的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>类型系统围绕&quot;一切皆向量&quot;展开，标量只是长度为 1 的向量。</li>\n<li>六种原子类型只能存同质元素；需要异质时用 list，需要表格时用 data.frame/tibble。</li>\n<li>类型强制转换按固定层级向上进行，混合类型向量会静默改变整体类型——这是常见的隐式 bug 来源。</li>\n<li>因子是整数向量加 <code>levels</code> 属性，在统计建模中自动展开为虚拟变量。</li>\n<li>S3 是最常用的对象系统，靠 <code>class</code> 属性与 <code>UseMethod()</code> 分派，理解它是读懂 R 生态包的基础。</li>\n<li>copy-on-modify 意味着&quot;修改&quot;才是复制的触发点，循环中增长向量会产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 开销——正确做法是预分配或改用向量化运算。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"R 数据类型与结构","id":"r-数据类型与结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"六种原子类型","id":"六种原子类型"},{"level":2,"text":"四种复合数据结构","id":"四种复合数据结构"},{"level":3,"text":"向量（Vector）","id":"向量-vector"},{"level":3,"text":"矩阵与数组（Matrix / Array）","id":"矩阵与数组-matrix-array"},{"level":3,"text":"列表（List）","id":"列表-list"},{"level":3,"text":"数据框（Data Frame）","id":"数据框-data-frame"},{"level":2,"text":"因子：分类数据的专用类型","id":"因子-分类数据的专用类型"},{"level":2,"text":"属性与 S3 类系统","id":"属性与-s3-类系统"},{"level":2,"text":"Copy-on-Modify 与内存模型","id":"copy-on-modify-与内存模型"},{"level":2,"text":"类型检查与转换的实践模式","id":"类型检查与转换的实践模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"向量化运算与函数式编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/fundamentals/vectorized-operations"}}